1	//! Credential document management and internal e-signing API handlers.
2	//!
3	//! Route map (all under `/api/v1/credentials` and `/api/v1/esignatures`):
4	//!
5	//! ```text
6	//! GET    /credentials                        — paginated list          (ViewCredentials)
7	//! POST   /credentials                        — upload document         (ViewCredentials)
8	//! POST   /credentials/expire                 — run expiry sweep        (ApproveCredentials)
9	//! GET    /credentials/{id}                   — detail + auto-log view  (ViewCredentials)
10	//! PATCH  /credentials/{id}/review            — approve / reject        (ApproveCredentials)
11	//! GET    /credentials/{id}/audit             — credential audit trail  (ViewCredentials)
12	//! POST   /credentials/{id}/esign             — attach e-signature      (ApproveCredentials)
13	//!
14	//! GET    /esignatures/{entity_type}/{entity_id} — list sigs for entity (ViewCredentials)
15	//! POST   /esignatures                            — sign any entity      (ViewCredentials)
16	//! ```
17	//!
18	//! File upload uses `actix-multipart`.  Files are stored under
19	//! `$UPLOAD_DIR/contractors/{contractor_id}/{fingerprint_prefix}_{filename}`.
20	//! A SHA-256 fingerprint is computed over raw file bytes for duplicate detection.
21	//! Only `application/pdf`, `image/jpeg`, and `image/png` are accepted (max 10 MB).
